.TH "derivations-by-zipola" "6" "2026-11-14" "Derivations User Manuals" ""
.hy
.SH NAME
.PP
derivations-by-zipola - 4k intro by zipola
.SH SYNOPSIS
.PP
derivations-by-zipola
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Derivations is a 4k intro written in C with SDL and OpenGL by zipola
(Tuomo Sipola), released in November 2010 at Instanssi I/2010, where it
ranked 7th in the combined demo compo.
.PP
The intro runs in a 1024x768 window and lasts 45 seconds.
Its sound is generated when it starts, so the window can stay black for
a moment.
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
This program has no options.
.SH KEYS
.TP
\f[B]Any key\f[R]
Quits the intro.
Closing the window also quits it.
